{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"lnfinitemoon","id":"511053966763884544","is_bot":0,"username":"huskiefolife"},"author_id":"511053966763884544","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Adrian enters the area (if there is a door he leaves a note if not he posts it on the wall.) ```Serfs needed to build a secure store house. The project is funded, all we need is 8 more laborers. Please send your workers to help out. This is urgent, we will be out of food by the end of the day if workers are not found. Please, for the love of our new home and the people, lend a hand.```","created_at":"2020-08-03T17:46:10.533000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739901945552175135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur comes back from gathering more lumber and pauses seeing the note that's been left, \"hmm, yeh I should help out.\" He says before grabbing his axe and heading towards town.","created_at":"2020-08-03T18:28:37.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739912629291843746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur arrives back at his Warenui after a long day of heavy lifting, his muscles are sore but he feels content after a job well done, he refills the bird seed in the covered cage, eats a light dinner of roasted seeds over the fire and collapses onto his bedroll.","created_at":"2020-08-04T04:29:46.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740063913093365810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"As Ozgur is drifting off, a thought crosses his mind 'Note to self. Build Bed.'","created_at":"2020-08-04T04:30:26.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740064078948597820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur begins his day with a bowl of porridge. Which he adds salt to. \nWith the main support structure completed, Ozgur begins work on the pitched roof that when done will result in a covered porch existing infront of the main entryway.","created_at":"2020-08-04T16:10:06.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740240158351425547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Using his Hangi Oven buried about a foot below the surface, Ozgur starts to make baked potatoes. He will make Baked Taewa with Fried Mushrooms as a side. Once he's finished cooking Ozgur sits on his new porch happily chowing down. He whistles between bites, and the creature in the cage beneath the sheet whistles back.","created_at":"2020-08-05T05:12:43.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740437109139046431","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up feeling refreshed and cooks up a plate of hash browns, after some breakfeast he takes a few steps back and regards his home. With the main structure completed, it's time to start work on the finer details, starting with the Maihi, leading to the Raparapa, and then the Amo. By the end, the entire building will appear as one beautifully intricate woodcarving.","created_at":"2020-08-05T16:14:09.804000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740603565667516487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur spends time before he sleeps picking splinters from his hands, but on the outside he's all smiles, the Carving is going well.","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:39:36.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740806261020426315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur spends the morning sanding the floor of his porch, and detailing the paepae carving running along the front edge of the Warenui, almost level with the ground.","created_at":"2020-08-06T17:15:39.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740981430779117578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up with a snort. He fell asleep while carving the Whakawae around the front-doorframe and now has a beard of woodshavings. He stretches and starts his regular morning routine.","created_at":"2020-08-07T17:42:34.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741350592538214521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur stands on a Carving block carefully balanced on a crate to reach the top apex of the Roof, where he begins to carefully carve the Ware's Koruru. It starts to take the shape of a wrinkled Tiefling man's face, his expression somber, as is Ozgur's as he thinks of his grandfather.","created_at":"2020-08-07T23:26:45.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741437208380178504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur reaches his home and stands under the gaze of the mostly complete Koruru. The face of his Tupuna stares down at him. He saw his greatest fear today. \"Just like you said Grampa...\" Ozgur says quietly, before heading inside. He refills the birdseed, though the creature under the sheet is already asleep. He lands with a groan on his bedroll, and falls asleep.","created_at":"2020-08-08T06:59:30.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741551144458780753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up with a start, he's been struck with inspiration. Getting up and and after eating a light breakfeast, Ozgur finds a section of Oak log 3 feet tall and 2 feet in diameter, rolling it around back, Ozgur circles it several times, hoping the protective spirit whithin will reveal itself. Finally he kneels, and begins to carve the Tekoteko.","created_at":"2020-08-08T16:33:47.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741695666820087920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur is making good progress, so engrossed in his woodcarving, he does not notice that the ground has turned to mud around his feet, and the water slowly rising around him.","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:20:22.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741722493282418758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur looks around his home, noticing the mud and standing water for the first time. He picks up his soaked bedroll and frowns. \"Hmm, that... won't do...\" He says before hanging it from the roof to dry. Ozgur sets to building a bedframe.","created_at":"2020-08-09T03:31:22.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741861154959261757","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
