{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Working by firelight, though not complete Ozgur is satisfied that the bedframe appears sturdy enough to sleep on, unceremoniously he drapes his still somewhat damp bedroll onto the wooden frame and climbs on. For a moment he frowns before letting out a laugh. \n\nOh silly him, he'd forgotten to take his Armor off. Ozgur then sits up and attempts to remove his helmet.\n\"...\"\n\n\"Uh oh.\"","created_at":"2020-08-09T06:52:44.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741911830779133963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up sore. Turns out sleeping in spiked plate mail is not comfortable. He rolls off of his as of yet unfinished bed and does some stretches, finding that to be difficult in the restrictive plate. Ozgur decides to go for a walk to think about his current predicament.","created_at":"2020-08-09T17:11:24.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742067522202894408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur arrives home feeling refreshed, better than he did this morning. He had a productive day in town, he toured the length of the new wall, he fed some ducks, he drank water from the pond the ducks were swimming in. Yessir today was a good day, Ozgur can't even remember why he was upse-\n\nOzgur sees his still incomplete bed and immidiately remembers he is stuck inside of his Armor, completely unable to remove it. His tail droops. \n\"Bugger.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T05:47:37.458000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742257831268450334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Copper does his boat over towards ozgurs door, he takes a note on it saying:\n\n> Hello, I understand that are able to build things. I am here to commission 4 rowboats. Please complete them as soon as possible. This is a town request so we have the funds ready for you upon completion\nSigned, Copper","created_at":"2020-08-10T20:09:16.433000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T20:09:25.707000Z","id":"742474672486219887","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur woke up with his bed floating in his front yard. He is currently sitting on his roof, covered birdcage next to him, reading over Copper's note. Ozgur rubs his chin with his gauntleted hand. He had constructed waka tīwai before with the help of his father and siblings, and it looked like it was time to put his boat building skills to use once more. \n\nOzgur jumps down from his roof and starts to wade through the mud and water, intent on finding several sizeable logs, getting to work immediately.","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:33:38.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742495903222333501","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur begins work on 4 Canoes, each one 3 meters long (about 10 feet.)","created_at":"2020-08-10T21:45:21.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742498854917898271","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
