{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Having returned successfully from the hunt, Ozgur begins placing Kindling material at the bottom of the pit. He then places flat stones on top of the wood. The kindling is lit with Thaumaturgy and the stones are allowed to heat. within 2 to 3 hours the stones will be ready for cooking.","created_at":"2020-08-15T22:45:01.854000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744325809350639676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Satisfied that the Lua will work, Ozgur adds more fuel to the fire, and will continue to do so throughout the night, keeping the stones *hot*.","created_at":"2020-08-16T01:03:49.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744360736888717384","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"A letter is left for <@!470420431841656833> “dear Ozgur, I understand you will be hosting a party. I would love to attend this, but I have too protect Lilia until 10pm tomorrow. We are performing a spell that will help save the town and requires full attention that we can not leave. I don’t mean to impede, but would it be possible to be the time of the party a bit so all helping with the spell may attend?”","created_at":"2020-08-16T10:04:25.916000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744496786219073619","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur finds Coppers note and smiles, he considers it and believes it would be perfectly reasonable to push the timing of the Luau to Tomarrow.","created_at":"2020-08-16T16:27:48.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744593264715366401","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up in the dead of night, he remembers a dream he had once, not too long ago. Koruha chirps lightly in Ozgur's dream. She sings a soothing song. And the song tells the story of two brothers. Their bond moves to betrayal and yet the tone of the song stays sweet. And as it crescendos and falls they age a life time separate from one another by decades of offense. And then again the chorus repeats. Once again they are young. And the Ozgur sees them, his heart heavy for the future that they will see. And the song of Koruha which springs from that heaviness gives him kindness and compassion, service and hope. He sings Koruha's song and the brothers are moved. Forgiven. Forgotten. Freed from a destiny full of regrets. \nAfter a few minutes, Ozgur returns to restless slumber.","created_at":"2020-08-17T07:36:32.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744821954317385739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up feeling chipper, and he begins preparations for the Luau tonight, He starts by digging a fire pit, making sure there is ample room for people to stand and sit around it.","created_at":"2020-08-17T16:18:45.260000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744953375400919195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
